{"product_id":"blvk-fusion-salt-grape-apple-ice","title":"BLVK Fusion Salt - Grape Apple Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Grape Apple Ice by BLVK Unicorn, featuring notes of sweet grapes enhanced with crisp apple served over ice in a delicious nicotine salt.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn Fusion - Grape Apple Ice Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBLVK Fusion Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\/50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted for Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in vape pod system and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every nicotine salts e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670548291639,"sku":"BLVK  - Grape Apple Ice 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670548324407,"sku":"BLVK  - Grape Apple Ice 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_fusion_salts_grape_apple_ice_box_bottle.png?v=1747708432","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blvk-fusion-salt-grape-apple-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




